    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16976" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀταρτ-ηρός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>mischievous, baneful,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀταρτηροῖς ἐπέεσσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					1.223
				</span></i>
			; of a person, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μέντορ ἀταρτηρέ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					2.243
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γενέθλη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Th.</u>
					610
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στόμα Πόντου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					22.28
				</span></i>
			; of wild beasts, <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				4.223
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				12.40
			</span></i>.</div>
